<title>UK: CCDJ adds 150 mln Sfr to April 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>CCDJ adds 150 mln Sfr to April 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, has been</p>
<p>increased to 300 million Swiss francs from 150 million Swiss</p>
<p>francs by lead manager Banca Del Gottardo Lugano and Merrill</p>
<p>Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DESJARDINS, MONTREAL</p>
<p> AMT   *300 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    28.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE  **09.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 LAST S&amp;P   AA</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 150 MLN SWISS FRANC BOND.</p>
<p>	    **PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
